        "TileImage": "$($repository a610f524-466d-4ac9-b3e8-861b37a9b848).Image",
        "Description": "Eccentric billionaire &amp; owner of the New York Tomcats baseball team, Heath Brennen is having trouble this season. The team is underperforming, &amp; lots of money is tied into player contracts he is trying to release. To cut some pay &amp; dead weight- Brennen requests you take out some of the team&apos;s investors at the M-P Bank to void their payouts, &amp; save budget for next season.\r\rHe also wants you to take out a couple sports podcasters/bettors that have been trouble for him in the media.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
